<title>JAPAN: Nichimen files shelf registration.</title>
<headline>Nichimen files shelf registration.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nichimen Corp, a Japanese general trader, said on Tuesday it had applied the Finance Ministry for a shelf registration to issue up to 60 billion yen worth of corporate bonds.</p>
<p>The registration will be effective for two years from April 22, it said.</p>
